# Perf route — Time Trial at New York in the Ferrari F2007 (the user's "Ferrari F1"; its name on the Car Selection frame dump), from the user's finished save (like save_trialmtn.pad;
# not a gate route): the scene where the laptop in power-saver dropped below 40 fps (user, 2026-10-31). Mode Selection
# three LEFTs to Time Trial and CROSS through its "My Records" popup (0x1d058440); Car Selection UP and RIGHT from the
# cursor (the save's "Latest 100 Acquired" list); Track Selection 12 RIGHTs to New York. Time Trial starts rolling and
# the car runs into the wall after the start line, so SQUARE is held and the measured scene (from ~430 s) is the car
# standing there: a steady view of the street, stands and the CLUT-animated screens (FINDINGS, patch 0058).
# Page offsets: race.pad and save_trialmtn.pad.
